              "text": "Harbor & Pine Outfitters: returns and repairs policy\n\nReturns. A customer may return any unworn item within 45 days of delivery. Items bought\non clearance can be exchanged but not refunded. Gift cards cannot be returned.\n\nRefunds. A refund goes back to the original payment method within 5 business days of\nthe return being received at the Portland warehouse. Return shipping is free for\nmembers of the Harbor Club and costs a flat 7 dollars for everyone else.\n\nRepairs. Jackets and packs carry a 2-year repair warranty from the date of purchase.\nA repair under warranty is free; outside the warranty the workshop quotes a price\nbefore any work starts. Repairs take about 3 weeks.\n\nContact. Questions about a return or a repair go to care@harborandpine.example, which\nanswers within one working day.",
